@startuml evolution_timeline_clean
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #333333

rectangle "Generation 1\nRule-Based\n(1990s-2000s)\n\nStatic Firewalls\nReactive Response" as Gen1 #FFE6E6
rectangle "Generation 2\nML Defense\n(2000s-2010s)\n\nPattern Recognition\nSignature Detection" as Gen2 #E6F3FF
rectangle "Generation 3\nAdaptive Learning\n(2010s-Present)\n\nDynamic Adaptation\nBehavior Analysis" as Gen3 #E6FFE6
rectangle "Generation 4\nAdversarial Learning\n(Our Work)\n\nPredictive Defense\nAdversarial Training" as Gen4 #FFFACD

Gen1 -right-> Gen2 : Evolution
Gen2 -right-> Gen3 : Evolution  
Gen3 -right-> Gen4 : **Our Contribution**

note bottom of Gen1 : 1990
note bottom of Gen2 : 2000
note bottom of Gen3 : 2010
note bottom of Gen4 : 2025

@enduml
